<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <!-- worktree-nodemodules-reaper ARMED (orch-console #61047, 2026-10-09). Routine Tier-1
       hygiene: every 30 min, clears ONLY gitignored node_modules/.next from PR worktrees that
       have NO live process cwd'd in them (lsof-protected, kill-time re-verified).
       Reversible (regenerable, git state untouched); NEVER removes worktrees and NEVER deletes a
       tracked/non-ignored dir. WHY armed, not detect-first: the exact clear was wet-proven live
       the same day (manual 5.8GB clear, 88%->86%) + unit + CLI wet-proof. Reversible: launchctl
       bootout this label.
       WIDENED (bus #68390, 2026-10-15): scope was cosem-platform.wt-* only; disk kept
       warn-flapping (88-89%) because 4 OTHER large worktree families (ihsanos-irsyad.wt-*,
       cosem-adcda.wt-*, cosem-port-lane.wt-*, cosem-tdu.wt-*) were never covered. A manual
       detect+apply pass against those 4 found/freed ~5GB of genuinely-idle node_modules/.next
       (same safety gates: 3 tracked ops/node_modules dirs correctly spared as NOT-IGNORED) with
       0 errors. Added them to NM_REAPER_FAMILIES here so the recurring consumer self-clears
       going forward instead of requiring another manual pass. Deliberately NOT included:
       cosem-video-pipeline (operator-held pending migration decommission, see
       [[hands-off-path]]-equivalent note in stale-worktree-reaper memory) and any non-`.wt-*`
       base checkout (those are live primary checkouts, not disposable PR worktrees). -->
  <key>Label</key>
  <string>dev.wingmen.worktree-nodemodules-reaper</string>
  <key>ProgramArguments</key>
  <array>
    <string>/bin/bash</string>
    <string>-lc</string>
    <string>cd "$HOME/wingmen/orchestrator" &amp;&amp; set -a &amp;&amp; . ./.env &amp;&amp; set +a &amp;&amp; unset ANTHROPIC_API_KEY &amp;&amp; export NM_REAPER_FAMILIES="$HOME/wingmen/projects/cosem-platform.wt-*:$HOME/wingmen/projects/ihsanos-irsyad.wt-*:$HOME/wingmen/projects/cosem-adcda.wt-*:$HOME/wingmen/projects/cosem-port-lane.wt-*:$HOME/wingmen/projects/cosem-tdu.wt-*" &amp;&amp; exec .venv/bin/python3 -m scripts.worktree_nodemodules_reaper --apply</string>
  </array>
  <key>StartInterval</key>
  <integer>1800</integer>
  <key>RunAtLoad</key>
  <true/>
  <key>StandardOutPath</key>
  <string>/Users/sheikhmusa/wingmen/orchestrator/logs/worktree_nodemodules_reaper.log</string>
  <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
  <string>/Users/sheikhmusa/wingmen/orchestrator/logs/worktree_nodemodules_reaper.log</string>
</dict>
</plist>
